            <description><![CDATA[<h2>MeetMouse 0.23.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li>MeetMouse now actually shows up as "MeetMouse" in Finder, the Dock, and Spotlight. If you updated from Meeting Coach, the app on disk kept its old `MeetingCoach.app` filename — it renames itself once on the next launch and reopens straight away. Settings, models, transcripts, permissions, and updates all carry over untouched</li>
</ul>
